SUMMARY:“Organic Reflections: Summertime Classics”
DESCRIPTION:Organist Larry Hershey will perform a concert entitled “Summertime Classics” at First Reformed Church. The free 30-minute concert will include Gershwin’s “Summertime” from Porgy and Bess\, “The Washington Post March” by John Phillips Sousa\, and Camille Saint-Sean’s “The Swan”. The program will conclude with “Evening Harmonies” by Sigfrid Karg-Elert\, and “Hornpipe” from Handel’s Water Music Suite.  \n\n\n\nThe First Friday “Organic Reflections” concert series is a gift to the community from First Reformed Church\, a center city congregation of the United Church of Christ. Doors open at 7:30 pm. All are welcome to hear 30 minutes of majestic music that will refresh your soul and inspire your spirit. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/organic-reflections-summertime-classics/
LOCATION:First Reformed Church\, 40 East Orange Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/2G3A9813.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="First Reformed Church":MAILTO:webmaster.FRCLancaster@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
