SUMMARY:World Traveler: Allegro's Staycation
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a little ‘staycation’ with Allegro as we close our 25th season! For this finale\, we’re going around the world and back in 80 minutes! We’ll go with Rossini to Algiers\, spend some time with Faure in France\, take a tour through Italy with Mendelssohn\, and return to the states for Brian Norcross’s new piece ‘Dogwood.’ \n\nThe full Allegro Orchestra will fill the hall of Barshinger Center with joyful music! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/world-traveler-allegros-staycation/
LOCATION:Barshinger Center at F&M College\, College Avenue\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
