SUMMARY:Next Gen: Round Table
DESCRIPTION:Next Gen Round Table is partnering with Annie Bailey’s Irish Public House to bring together four local leaders for an interactive\, small-group learning experience. Attendees will rotate between each leader in twenty-minute sessions. Every leader will follow a structured guide\, and guests will receive thoughtful questions to help spark meaningful conversation. This event is designed to build relationships\, share insights\, and create an approachable space to learn from leaders in our community.  Sponsored by: A1 Energy and Viocity. \n\n\n\n We also need your help! NextGen is partnering with Conestoga Valley Christian Community Services to support their Weekend Blessings Program\, which sends food home with children for the weekend. If you bring one of the items below to this free event\, you will receive an extra raffle ticket as a thank you for supporting the cause. Most needed items: Pop-top cans of soup Chef Boyardee-type canned pasta Mac and cheese cups Ramen or cup noodles Fruit cups Applesauce cups Thank you for helping us make an impact beyond the room! \n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/next-gen-round-table-6/
LOCATION:Annie Bailey’s Irish Public House\, 28-30 East King Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/Next-Gen-Round-Table-August-Meet-the-Leaders.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Next Generation of Lancaster%2C PA":MAILTO:ej.pratt522@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
