SUMMARY:Greenfield 2026 Summer Concert Series: 70s Live
DESCRIPTION:Groove is in session. \n\n\n\nGreenfield transforms into a dazzling ’70s dance floor in partnership with Prima Theatre\, featuring top‑tier talent delivering the decade’s most beloved hits. From Fleetwood Mac and Elton John to ABBA and The Bee Gees\, this high‑energy showcase captures the unmistakable magic of the disco era. \n\n\n\nThis concert is FREE and open to all. No tickets required.  \n\n\n\n\nConcert begins at 7:30 PM (held rain or shine!)\n\n\n\nFood Trucks will be on site by 5:00 PM – expected vendors are…\n\nGourmet Julie’s Way\n\n\n\nStoney’s Burgers and Fries\n\n\n\nWalk-O Taco\n\n\n\nRad-ish\n\n\n\nGreco’s\n\n\n\nCupcakes by Casey\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNEW THIS YEAR! All concerts take place at Greenfield\, right across from the Calvin G. High Pavilion (1828 William Penn Way). Grab your friends\, bring your lawn chairs\, and settle in for summer nights filled with great music and great company! \n\n\n\nProductions by Prima Theatre \n\n\n\n\n    Learn more
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/greenfield-2026-summer-concert-series-70s-live/
LOCATION:Calvin G. High Pavilion\, 1828 William Penn Way\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/avif:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/06/70s-live-logo.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Greenfield":MAILTO:greenfieldinfo@high.net
END:VEVENT
