SUMMARY:Celebrate Lancaster
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Lancaster is Lancaster City’s largest block party of the year! Join us for our annual celebration of Lancaster City’s vibrant residents and cultures. Featuring dozens of food trucks\, live music\, family entertainment\, and a headlining performance by Grammy Award-winning R&B group 112!\n\nCome hungry! Enjoy a variety of food trucks serving up everything from local favorites and festival classics to sweet treats and refreshing drinks. There’s something for every taste to enjoy throughout the day.\n\nExplore a diverse marketplace featuring local artisans\, makers\, nonprofits\, and community organizations. Shop unique goods\, discover local resources\, and connect with people and businesses.\n\nExperience the energy of Celebrate Lancaster with live performances from talented artists. From family-friendly entertainment to crowd-favorite bands\, the stage will be filled with excitement all evening long — plus a special FREE performance by 112! \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/celebrate-lancaster-5/
LOCATION:000 to 100 Blocks North Queen Street
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/LancCity_CelebrateLanc_16-9.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="City of Lancaster":MAILTO:info@cityoflancasterpa.gov
END:VEVENT
