SUMMARY:Free 112 Concert
DESCRIPTION:112 is headlining Lancaster’s largest block party\, Celebrate Lancaster on August 14th\, and it’s FREE! Catch the R&B legends behind “Peaches & Cream\,” “Cupid\,” and “Come See Me” live at Binns Park\, starting at 8 PM. \n\nCome early and join in the fun! Celebrate Lancaster kicks off at 11am\, with food trucks\, live music\, a family zone\, artisan vendors\, and so much more. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/free-112-concert/
