SUMMARY:Third Story Artist Talk and Book Signing with Sarah Bourne Rafferty
DESCRIPTION:Sarah Bourne Rafferty will be joining Third Story for a free Artist’s Talk\, followed by a book-signing of her beautiful new book\, “Botanical Cyanotype: A Guide to the Art of Sun Printing” Sarah has an MFA in Printmaking and Book Arts from The University of the Arts. In addition to creating the original cyanotypes that drive Atwater Designs\, she is an educator and creative mentor. She has work in our current gallery exhibit\, Tapestry\, as well as unframed\, original cyanotypes in our flat file. Sarah is one of Third Story Art’s favorite artists to talk with about creativity\, studio practices\, motivation and mind set. We know this talk is going to be great! And of course\, we will also be talking about Sarah’s new book: “Botanical Cyanotype: a Guide to the Art of Sun Printing” Sarah will be signing books following our discussion. If you are interested in her book\, pre-order and Third Story Art will hold it for you until the day of the signing so that Sarah can personalize it for you. You can find a link to pre-order at www.thirdstoryart.com \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/third-story-artist-talk-and-book-signing-with-sarah-bourne-rafferty/
LOCATION:Third Story Art\, 44 North Christian Street\, Suite 300\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/26FlatFileBourneRafferty_Grapevines-Sarah-Rafferty-scaled.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Third Story":MAILTO:hello@thirdstoryart.com
END:VEVENT
