SUMMARY:Botanical Cyanotype Workshop with Atwater Designs
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a summer afternoon in the sun! Join artist and author Sarah Bourne Rafferty of Atwater Designs for this 2-hour botanical cyanotype class. You will use summer blooms to create blue and white prints using one of the earliest photographic processes. Each participant will enjoy a short history lesson about the process\, instruction by a local artist and author\, and an hour to experiment. You will take home at least 2 original prints to frame or gift. Light refreshments provided. Each participant will have the opportunity to buy Sarah’s cyanotype kit at a discounted price the end of the workshop. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/botanical-cyanotype-workshop-with-atwater-designs/
LOCATION:Gallery Grow\, 320 North Queen Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/2-Botanical-Cyanotype-Workshop.avif
END:VEVENT
