SUMMARY:Culinary Night at Kegel's Produce
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an inspiring evening celebrating Lancaster’s vibrant culinary scene with the visionairies behind Soulvaki Boys\, Rachel’s Creperie\, John Wright Restaurant\, and Philthy Good. In true Next Generation of Lancaster spirit\, this event goes beyond tasting—it’s a chance to connect\, collaborate\, and hear the stories behind the dishes that define our community. Enjoy a curated tasting from each chef and engage with fellow young professionals as we spotlight the creativity and excellence that make Lancaster a true food destination. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/culinary-night-at-kegels-produce-2/
